    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it just feels like if experts say density is way better for the environment and making things affordable, then the people fighting it are just standing in the way of progress. at what point do we stop listening to these \"neighborhood character\" arguments and just do what’s objectively better for the city?",
